{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you create a lasting civilization or see it collapse into the sea?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sea, Sun &amp; Salt, you build a city on a small mediterranean island. Define the tenets of your culture, deal with your subjects' needs and withstand the forces of the elements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Sea, Sun &amp; Salt</i>, where you can <strong>begin building your civilization</strong> and experience several of the early stages of development. It\u2019s the perfect chance to get a taste of the city-building, decision-making, and survival mechanics before diving into the full game.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005760/extras/e38cd2682d59d291fa15077f8134a6e5.avif?t=1759491831\" width=800 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2>Progress through the game and build a magnificent city. The further you go, the more complex your city's needs will get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005760/extras/4c5b40c4e10564502272b216529a0b4b.avif?t=1759491831\" width=800 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2>If you fail your subjects, your city will not last long. Water recedes when times are good but when things go wrong, beware of the rising tide.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005760/extras/d73febfbe5917fea0f5ff5758c7d29db.avif?t=1759491831\" width=800 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide</h2>As your city's population grows, your subjects will look up to you for answers. How was the world created? What do they worship? When's the best time to bathe? Make these choices, and more, to direct your people.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005760/extras/c542168a5827f6e9a5ae8f031287b5ac.avif?t=1759491831\" width=800 height=231 /></span><br><br>Also features:<br><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A gentle difficulty progression fit for all player types<br></li><li>Over 100 unique buildings<br></li><li>A progression system with over 15 eras<br></li><li>Complete runs of more than 10 hours<br></li><li>30 achievements that introduce new challenges for the more hard-core players<br></li><li>A relaxing sound track by William King<br></li><li>And many secrets hidden in the depth</li></ul><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005760?t=1759491831","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005760?t=1759491831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005760/8a0c61c2383f50810de07508c9d9719466ef8bbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759491831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005760/8a0c61c2383f50810de07508c9d9719466ef8bbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759491831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you create a lasting civilization or see it collapse into the sea?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sea, Sun &amp; Salt, you build a city on a small mediterranean island. Define the tenets of your culture, deal with your subjects' needs and withstand the forces of the elements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Sea, Sun &amp; Salt</i>, where you can <strong>begin building your civilization</strong> and experience several of the ear